= The <span style="color: #a2c617;">**Gedag**</span>

Current Leader: Hans Bechly

Dominant Union: German National Union of Commercial Employees (<span style="color: #a2c617;">**DHV**</span>)

The <span style="color: #a2c617;">**Gedag**</span> is a 

- @yellow_union: Drive out the yellow unions from the bourgeois parties
- @nazi_purge: Guard against the increasing influence of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazi**</span> movement in the <span style="color: #a2c617;">**DHV**</span>
- @csvd_rally: Conduct joint rallies with the <span style="color: #8ED8E4;">**CSVD**</span>
- @fund_nazi: Fund the left wing of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span>
- @easy_discard

@yellow_union
subtitle: Closely affliated with employers, the yellow unions have jostled with the <span style="color: #000000;">**DGB**</span> over influence in the parties of the bourgeois right. This has allowed industrialists in the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span> and <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> a disproportionate say in party affairs, hampering the passage of pro labor legislation in the Reichstag.
choose-if: year < 1930
unavailable-subtitle: The yellow unions have collapsed under the weight of their own incompetence.
