how to slime them?

@nazi_purge
subtitle: In light of the ongoing economic crisis, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span> have been making huge inroads amidst our union members. 
choose-if: unemployment > 7
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> is not a potent force right now. 
